      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sprang up around the 1860 railroad depot, which later became a post office and now houses the Herndon Depot Museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        14,
